  "kind": "resolution-paper",
  "original_status": "proved",
  "scope": "For the exact generator-sum Cayley and color-position Schreier adjacency operators at (m,n)=(4,2) defined in source.md and problem.md, the second adjacency eigenvalue of each operator is 2*sqrt(2). Consequently their unnormalized adjacency spectral gaps satisfy psi_{4,2}=beta_{4,2}=4-2*sqrt(2). This statement concerns only the single frozen cell (4,2).",
